  "job_B14.24_20251003_114306": {
    "chunk_text": "eweor\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t Christen man gewifige in VI manna sibf\u00e6ce on his agenum cynne, \u00fe\u00e6t is Ne on gehalgodre \u00e6nigre nunnan, ne on his gef\u00e6deran, ne on \u00e6l\u00e6tan \u00e6nig Cristen man ne gewifige Ne na ma wifa \u00feonne an h\u00e6bbe; ac beo be \u00fe\u00e6re anre, \u00fea hwile \u00fee heo libbe, se \u00fee wille Godes lage & sy \u00e6lc cyrice on Godes gri\u00fee & on \u00fe\u00e6s cynges & on ealles Cristenes folces. & sy \u00e6lc cyricgri\u00f0 binnan wagum & cyninges handgri\u00f0 efen unwemme. & \u00e6nig man heonan for\u00f0 cyrican ne \u00feowige, ne cyricmangunge mid unrihte ne macige, ne cyric\u00feen ne & gel\u00e6ste man Godes gerihta \u00e6ghwilce geare rihtlice georne, \u00fe\u00e6t is sulh\u00e6lmessan huru XV niht ofer & gif man \u00e6nig lic of rihtscire elles hwar lecge, gel\u00e6ste man \u00feone saulsceat swa \u00feeh into \u00feam mynstre, & ealle Godes gerihta fyr\u00ferige man georne, ealswa hit \u00feearf is. & freolsa & f\u00e6stena healde man rihtlice. Sunnand\u00e6ges freols healde man georne, swa \u00fe\u00e6rto gebyrige; & cypinga & folcgemota & hunta\u00f0fara & sancta Marian heahfreolstida ealle weor\u00f0ige man georne, \u00e6rest mid f\u00e6stene & sy\u00fe\u00fean mid freolse. & to \u00e6ghwilces apostoles heahtide f\u00e6ste man georne, butan to Philippus & Iacobus freolse ne beode Elles o\u00fere freolsa & f\u00e6stena healde man georne, swa swa \u00fea heoldan \u00fea \u00fee betst heold",
